  "conclusions": [
    "O tail constructs actual shapes(r,r),(r,128),(r,128) and invokes automatic TileMmadTla overload.",
    "Automatic overload forwards m,n,k from originShape; no software pad-to64 or pad-to16. On3510 non-VectorLayout disableGemv=true.",
    "CANN3510 BF16 MmadCal passes raw m,k,n to mad intrinsic; no intermediate host/runtime rounding in inspected code.",
    "Published3510 theoretical MMAD timing uses ceil_m=ceil16(m),ceil_n=ceil16(n),ceil_k=ceil_k0(k), BF16 cube16x16x16,k0=16.",
    "Thus raw/source useful shape and physical issued/fractal work must remain separate. DeltaT is a separate per-instruction startup quantity, not an unexplained efficiency factor."
  ],
